<mxfile host="drawio" version="24.7.17"><diagram id="01-agendar-consulta" name="01-agendar-consulta"><mxGraphModel dx="800" dy="600" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nhide footbox\nskinparam sequence {\n    ArrowColor Black\n    LifeLineBorderColor Gray\n    MessageAlign center\n}\nskinparam participant {\n    BorderColor transparent\n    FontColor White\n    Padding 20\n}\n\nactor \&quot;Cliente / Atendente\&quot; as User \nparticipant \&quot;WebFrontend\&quot; as Tela #BE2C2E\nparticipant \&quot;AgendaAppService\&quot; as Control #87A446\nparticipant \&quot;Disponibilidade\&quot; as Disp #5B9BD5\nparticipant \&quot;Agendamento\&quot; as Agend #5B9BD5\nparticipant \&quot;MySQLRepository\&quot; as Repo #E76F26\nparticipant \&quot;ComunicacaoAppService\&quot; as ComService #5B9BD5\nparticipant \&quot;Notificação\&quot; as Notif #5B9BD5\nparticipant \&quot;NotificationServiceAdapter\&quot; as NotifAdapter #F4B324\n\nactivate User #0B4A6A\n\nUser -&gt; Tela: solicitarAgendamento(dataHora)\nactivate Tela #BE2C2E\n\nTela -&gt; Control: processarAgendamento(dataHora)\nactivate Control #87A446\n\nControl -&gt; Repo: buscar(idPsicologo)\nactivate Repo #E76F26\nRepo --&gt; Control: Disponibilidade\ndeactivate Repo\n\nControl -&gt; Disp: contém(dataHora)\nactivate Disp #5B9BD5\nDisp --&gt; Control: Boolean\ndeactivate Disp\n\nalt Horário Livre (Boolean = true)\n    \n    Control -&gt; Agend **: &lt;&lt;create&gt;&gt; (Situação = Agendada)\n    \n    Control -&gt; Repo: salvar(Agendamento)\n    activate Repo #E76F26\n    Repo --&gt; Control: void\n    deactivate Repo\n    \n    Control -&gt; ComService: notificar()\n    activate ComService #5B9BD5\n    \n    ComService -&gt; Notif **: &lt;&lt;create&gt;&gt;\n    ComService -&gt; NotifAdapter: enviar(Notificação)\n    activate NotifAdapter #F4B324\n    NotifAdapter --&gt; ComService: void\n    deactivate NotifAdapter\n    \n    ComService -&gt; Notif: registrarSituaçãoEnvio()\n    activate Notif #5B9BD5\n    Notif --&gt; ComService: void\n    deactivate Notif\n    \n    ComService --&gt; Control: void\n    deactivate ComService\n    \n    Control --&gt; Tela: sucesso\n    Tela --&gt; User: exibirComprovante()\n    \nelse Horário Ocupado (Boolean = false)\n    Control --&gt; Tela: erro(Indisponível)\n    Tela --&gt; User: exibirErro()\nend\n\ndeactivate Control\ndeactivate Tela\ndeactivate User\n@enduml\n&quot;, &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;}" id="uml"><mxCell style="shape=image;noLabel=1;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="1785" height="774" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>